Here is the plan: three small milestones.

```json
{
  "milestones": [
    {
      "id": "m1",
      "title": "Todo storage module",
      "description": "Create todo.js with load/save/add/done/format helpers backed by todos.json. Context: Build a tiny todo CLI",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "add() numbers items consecutively",
        "done() marks exactly one item",
        "items survive a save/load round trip"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m2",
      "title": "Command line interface",
      "description": "Create cli.js: `add <text>`, `list` and `done <id>` on top of todo.js.",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "`node cli.js add \"x\"` prints the list including x",
        "`node cli.js done 1` marks item 1 done",
        "unknown commands print usage and exit 1"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "m3",
      "title": "Tests and README",
      "description": "Add node:test tests for todo.js and a README with usage.",
      "acceptanceCriteria": [
        "`node --test` passes",
        "README documents add, list and done"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
```

